msgid ""
"Create one ``StamPLC`` object, then access relay outputs, digital inputs,"
" and the built-in RGB LED from that object."
msgstr "创建一个 ``StamPLC`` 对象后，可以通过该对象访问继电器输出、数字输入和内置 RGB LED。"

